"""원 목표 제어를 상속하고 압현 선행 뒤 타현하는 모션만 연결한다."""
from ..grounded_guitar_support_v1.runtime_v18 import Controller as PreparedController
from .runtime_v1 import Scene, Controller as OriginalPlayController


class Controller(OriginalPlayController):
    def __init__(self, scene):
        PreparedController.__init__(self, scene)
        assert scene.cfg['seconds'] == 16 and scene.cfg['mode'] == 'static'
        assert scene.cfg['validation_protocol'] == 'finite_prepare5_hold5_fret_then_strike6_v1'
        assert scene.cfg['play_case'] == 'combined'
        assert scene.cfg['play_action_interval_s'] == [10, 16]
        assert scene.cfg['strike_start_s'] == 11.3
        assert scene.cfg['right_strike_interval_s'] == [11.3, 14.8]
        assert scene.cfg['finger_hold_end_s'] == 16
        from .motion_v6 import Motion
        scene.play_logic = Motion(scene, self.fk)
        self.play_latch = None
